  "analysis_md": "$\\begin{aligned}\n\\lim_{\\substack{x\\to0\\\\y\\to0}}\\frac{1-\\cos(x^2+y^2)}{(x^2+y^2)e^{x^2y^2}}\n&=\\lim_{\\substack{x\\to0\\\\y\\to0}}\\frac{2\\sin^2\\left(\\dfrac{x^2+y^2}{2}\\right)}{(x^2+y^2)e^{x^2y^2}}\\\\\n&=\\lim_{\\substack{x\\to0\\\\y\\to0}}\\frac{2\\left(\\dfrac{x^2+y^2}{2}\\right)^2}{(x^2+y^2)e^{x^2y^2}}\\\\\n&=\\lim_{\\substack{x\\to0\\\\y\\to0}}\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2e^{x^2y^2}}\n=\\frac12\\lim_{\\substack{x\\to0\\\\y\\to0}}(x^2+y^2)\\lim_{\\substack{x\\to0\\\\y\\to0}}e^{-x^2y^2}\n=\\frac12\\cdot0\\cdot1=0.\n\\end{aligned}$",
